r-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["1094c3c3-975f-530e-bff0-7807d9d9ab97" "334bed91-dadd-511d-a2e8-3228c1bd2233"] :answer-field/correct "1094c3c3-975f-530e-bff0-7807d9d9ab97" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "ac6bf26c-daf9-5149-b82c-ecff54a2e1d7" :question/id #uuid "ac6bf26c-daf9-5149-b82c-ecff54a2e1d7" :question/problem "Consider the matrix \n$B=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}].$\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $B$ is upper triangular\n- **II.** $B$ is lower triangular\n- **III.** $B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular" :question/worked-solution "Let's analyze each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is true, since all the entries below the main diagonal equal to zero:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false, since $B$ has non-zero entries above the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false, since the result of $B-{B}^{T}$ has non-zero entries below the main diagonal:\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 6 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 0 & -7 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["1f123478-0b1d-5380-b456-3eb2029b111c" "a54ab5f5-3aa4-5cb2-a67f-b05de4913639" "8f11f16f-2bde-5b13-90cc-e018dd7a5dfc"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "2ead4764-174c-5d84-bcf9-29e935ade0e4" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186119784.py"} [:db/add 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] {:db/id 17592186119784 :knowledge-point/questions ["ac6bf26c-daf9-5149-b82c-ecff54a2e1d7"]} [:db/ensure 175921861